# Docs Directory

This directory stores document fragments or extra documentation that you want to include in the collection.

Fragments are placed inside of the collection README when it is generated by `ansidocs`

Supported fragments for the collection level docs directrory include:
  - description.md (A markdown file that will be injected as the description section in the collection readme)
  - usage.md (A markdown file that will be injected as the usage section in the collection readme)
